 "dur": 45.0,
 "target": 45.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Barry stepped onto Fluff Meadow and sank till only his hat showed.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 3.288
  },
  {
   "text": "He'd bet Tess a carrot cake he'd beat her to the cocoa hut.",
   "s": 3.488,
   "e": 6.045
  },
  {
   "text": "Tess strapped two giant tennis rackets to her boots. So why don't snowshoes sink?",
   "s": 6.245,
   "e": 10.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Barry climbed out. \"Easy peasy. I'll run faster.\"",
   "s": 10.47,
   "e": 12.756
  },
  {
   "text": "He ran so fast he dug a tunnel and popped up under Clover the rabbit.",
   "s": 12.876,
   "e": 16.286
  },
  {
   "text": "Clover wanted one thing: that carrot cake.",
   "s": 16.486,
   "e": 18.38
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Easy peasy!\" Pogo stick. One bounce, and he stuck like a carrot in a snowman.",
   "s": 18.58,
   "e": 22.052
  },
  {
   "text": "Clover sniffed him. Hopefully.",
   "s": 22.252,
   "e": 23.639
  },
  {
   "text": "Meanwhile, Tess strolled across the top like a sidewalk. What's the trick?",
   "s": 23.839,
   "e": 27.087
  },
  {
   "text": "Barry pushed his whole weight through two tiny shoes, like a finger poking pudding.",
   "s": 27.387,
   "e": 31.311
  },
  {
   "text": "Tess spread that push over two huge rackets, so each patch of snow holds a little.",
   "s": 31.511,
   "e": 35.737
  },
  {
   "text": "And Clover? Rabbits are born with snowshoes: those giant back feet.",
   "s": 36.137,
   "e": 39.345
  },
  {
   "text": "Clover reached the cocoa hut first and ate the cake. Easy peasy.",
   "s": 39.545,
   "e": 43.273
  }
 ],
